      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      * CTLREC - RUN CONTROL RECORD (CONTROL.DAT), 80 BYTES
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  CTL-RECORD.
           05  CTL-START-DATE          PIC X(8).
